{"id":"n67426-1-7","stage":4,"title":"엉금엉금 · 慢慢腾腾地","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67426-1-7-1","ko":"출근길이어서 도로가 꽉 막혔네.","zh":"正赶上上班时间，路堵得严严实实。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"출근길이어서","meaning":"上班路上，上班途中","explanation":"출근길：上班路上，上班途中；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"출근길","audio":"/audio/5f9dfb0f54bfb0bf6dbe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79079","senseId":"1","lemma":"출근길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도로가","meaning":"道路，公路","explanation":"도로：道路，公路；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"도로","audio":"/audio/60982a61e50d3bea9c66.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47886","senseId":"1","lemma":"도로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꽉","meaning":"满，满满","explanation":"꽉：满，满满","readings":[{"term":"꽉","audio":"/audio/991291daac49a3be8f11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14647","senseId":"2","lemma":"꽉","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"막혔네.","meaning":"堵住","explanation":"막히다：堵住；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"막히다","audio":"/audio/23886d293fd139686d2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29777","senseId":"6","lemma":"막히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5f9dfb0f54bfb0bf","term":"출근길","zh":"上班路上，上班途中","audio":"/audio/5f9dfb0f54bfb0bf6dbe.mp3","entryId":"79079","definition":"去单位上班的路上；或指上班的途中。","pronunciation":["출근낄"]},{"id":"60982a61e50d3bea","term":"도로","zh":"道路，公路","audio":"/audio/60982a61e50d3bea9c66.mp3","entryId":"47886","definition":"供人或车通行而建造的路。","pronunciation":["도ː로"]},{"id":"991291daac49a3be","term":"꽉","zh":"满，满满","audio":"/audio/991291daac49a3be8f11.mp3","entryId":"14647","definition":"充满或很多的样子。","pronunciation":["꽉"]},{"id":"23886d293fd13968","term":"막히다","zh":"堵住","audio":"/audio/23886d293fd139686d2a.mp3","entryId":"29777","definition":"由于交通堵塞，车辆无法正常行驶。","pronunciation":["마키다"]}],"audio":"/audio/86f2f75d7a200e59db11.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67426-1-7-2","ko":"이렇게 엉금엉금 움직이면 차보다 걷는 게 빠르겠어.","zh":"车这么慢慢挪，走路都比坐车快。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엉금엉금","meaning":"慢慢腾腾地，慢慢呑呑地","explanation":"엉금엉금：慢慢腾腾地，慢慢呑呑地","readings":[{"term":"엉금엉금","audio":"/audio/4b856b9e4eba3d1e3e07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67426","senseId":"1","lemma":"엉금엉금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"움직이면","meaning":"移动，动","explanation":"움직이다：移动，动；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"움직이다","audio":"/audio/05377c221a1ec6760c83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58166","senseId":"2","lemma":"움직이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차보다","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걷는","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빠르겠어.","meaning":"快，快速","explanation":"빠르다：快，快速；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"빠르다","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68755","senseId":"2","lemma":"빠르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"4b856b9e4eba3d1e","term":"엉금엉금","zh":"慢慢腾腾地，慢慢呑呑地","audio":"/audio/4b856b9e4eba3d1e3e07.mp3","entryId":"67426","definition":"以大动作缓慢走路或爬行的样子。","pronunciation":["엉그멍금"]},{"id":"05377c221a1ec676","term":"움직이다","zh":"移动，动","audio":"/audio/05377c221a1ec6760c83.mp3","entryId":"58166","definition":"从一处挪向另一处。","pronunciation":["움지기다"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"904de91feaff572f","term":"빠르다","zh":"快，快速","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3","entryId":"68755","definition":"从一处移动到其它地方所用的时间短。","pronunciation":["빠르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/39d8e62422481ca978ad.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.169,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67426","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":146,"sequenceScore":2.8943,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["正赶上上班时间，路堵得严严实实。","车这么慢慢挪，走路都比坐车快。","听说了吗？金科长上周辞职了哦。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["正赶上上班时间，路堵得严严实实。","车这么慢慢挪，走路都比坐车快。","听说了吗？金科长上周辞职了哦。"],"answer":1}]}
